OL,3,GNEWSABorder service finds no offences
OL,4,Aon private boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA maritime border operation targeting
OL,7,Fprivate boats arriving in Jersey found
OL,8,Fno offences and only minor breaches of
OL,9,Fcustoms and immigration rules,
OL,10,Fofficials said.
OL,12,FThe Jersey Customs and Immigration
OL,13,FService (JCIS) worked with officers
OL,14,Ffrom the UK Border Security Command
OL,15,Fduring a planned enforcement operation
OL,16,Fbetween 4 and 6 September.
OL,18,FTeams aboard HM Cutter Vigilant
OL,19,Fmonitored vessels entering Jersey
OL,20,Fwaters, with a number of motorboats and
OL,21,Fsailing boats examined.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
