OL,3,GNEWSABorder service finds no offences
OL,4,Aon private boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate vessels travelling from outside
OL,7,Fthe Common Travel Area must submit a
OL,8,FMaritime Declaration before entering
OL,9,FJersey. The operation found a high
OL,10,Flevel of compliance among boat
OL,11,Foperators, with only minor
OL,12,Finfringements detected.
